"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TFormData"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TValue"},{"type":"text","value":">"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"returns","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Returns"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"number"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"example","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Example"}]},{"type":"code","value":"triggerDebounceMs: ({ triggerFieldApi }) =>\n  triggerFieldApi?.name === 'search' ? 300 : 0,","lang":"ts"}],"headings":[{"id":"type-parameters","text":"Type Parameters","level":2},{"id":"tformdata","text":"TFormData","level":3},{"id":"tvalue","text":"TValue","level":3},{"id":"parameters","text":"Parameters","level":2},{"id":"context","text":"context","level":3},{"id":"returns","text":"Returns","level":2},{"id":"example","text":"Example","level":2}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n```ts\ntype ListenerDebounceFn<TFormData, TValue> = (context) => number;\n```\n\nDefined in: [listeners.public.ts:147](https://github.com/TanStack/form/blob/main/packages/form-core/src/listeners.public.ts#L147)\n\nCalculates a listener's debounce delay from the current event context.\n\nThe function is called after a trigger matches and its condition is enabled.\nThe returned number is interpreted as milliseconds; values less than or\nequal to `0` run immediately. The function is not called for `'submit'`\nevents because they always run immediately.\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TFormData\n\n`TFormData`\n\nLibrary-managed. Do not specify explicitly.\n\n### TValue\n\n`TValue`\n\nLibrary-managed. Do not specify explicitly.\n\n## Parameters\n\n### context\n\n[`ListenerPredicateContext`](../interfaces/ListenerPredicateContext.md)\\<`TFormData`, `TValue`\\>\n\n## Returns\n\n`number`\n\n## Example\n\n```ts\ntriggerDebounceMs: ({ triggerFieldApi }) =>\n  triggerFieldApi?.name === 'search' ? 300 : 0,\n```\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: ListenerDebounceFn\ntitle: ListenerDebounceFn\n---\n\n```ts\ntype ListenerDebounceFn<TFormData, TValue> = (context) => number;\n```\n\nDefined in: [listeners.public.ts:147](https://github.com/TanStack/form/blob/main/packages/form-core/src/listeners.public.ts#L147)\n\nCalculates a listener's debounce delay from the current event context.\n\nThe function is called after a trigger matches and its condition is enabled.\nThe returned number is interpreted as milliseconds; values less than or\nequal to `0` run immediately. The function is not called for `'submit'`\nevents because they always run immediately.\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TFormData\n\n`TFormData`\n\nLibrary-managed. Do not specify explicitly.\n\n### TValue\n\n`TValue`\n\nLibrary-managed. Do not specify explicitly.\n\n## Parameters\n\n### context\n\n[`ListenerPredicateContext`](../interfaces/ListenerPredicateContext.md)\\<`TFormData`, `TValue`\\>\n\n## Returns\n\n`number`\n\n## Example\n\n```ts\ntriggerDebounceMs: ({ triggerFieldApi }) =>\n  triggerFieldApi?.name === 'search' ? 300 : 0,\n```\n"}
